# CoTime

Same conventions as CoMission. Fail fast. No fallbacks or dual data formats. No `any`. No `Alert.alert()` — use ConfirmModal.

- DB only through `src/api/`. Component → Store → API → Database.
- Game logic lives in `src/game/` as pure functions with tests. API applies rule outcomes inside transactions.
- Identify users by uid. Models flat.
- Zustand stores own backend data and `onSnapshot`. Hooks are UI/device wiring only.
- All copy through i18n (`src/i18n/locales/en.json` + `he.json`), all text through `AppText`. 44pt targets.
- New pure module → matching test in `__tests__/`.
